sequenceDiagram
    participant HW as Physical GPU Node
    participant M3 as Metal3 (Ironic)
    participant KAI as KAI Scheduler
    participant Argo as ArgoCD
    participant SB as Standby BareMetalHost

    HW--xM3: BMC heartbeat lost (Power Failure)
    M3->>CP: Mark Node as NotReady / Tainted
    CP->>KAI: Evict Pods (PyTorchJob interrupted)
    KAI->>KAI: Re-queue distributed training job
    M3->>Argo: Alert: Compute capacity degraded
    Argo->>M3: Request replacement node provision
    M3->>SB: Power on via iDRAC
    SB-->>M3: PXE Boot & Inspect
    M3->>SB: Flash OS Image
    SB-->>CP: Join K8s Cluster
    KAI->>SB: Schedule queued PyTorchJob pods
    Note over HW, SB: Cluster healed with zero human intervention
